# SC-1: Entity–Control–Boundary (ECB)

Physical path SSOT: [docs/PRD.md](docs/PRD.md) §6.1.

| ECB | Path | Role |
|-----|------|------|
| Entity | `src/entity/` | Registry, ConversionService, domain models/exceptions — **no I/O** |
| Control | `src/control/` | Use cases — orchestrates Entity only |
| Boundary | `src/boundary/` | Parser, Validator, Formatters, Config loaders, CLI |

```
boundary → control → entity
entity   → (no imports from control or boundary)
```

**MUST NOT:** `elif unit == "..."` chains; hardcoded ratios in Boundary; I/O in Entity.

Logical PRD layers map to ECB: domain→entity, application→control, input/output/infrastructure/cli→boundary.
